# Files the deployment does not need. Keeps the upload small.
#
# Note that this file existing at all is load-bearing: without it the Vercel CLI
# falls back to .gitignore. That mattered enormously when the explainer video was
# excluded from git, and it is worth remembering before adding a build artifact
# to .gitignore that the site actually needs.
node_modules
.vite
*.local
.DS_Store
*.tsbuildinfo
.env*
.git
docs
scripts
